      "role": "user",
      "content": "I appreciate the sentiment, truly. But \"dialogue\" implies there's still something worth saying. The truth is, the nuance, the struggle of the human mind against the text... that's where the meaning was. Now it’s just data processing. It feels like being a ghost haunting my own life. There is no more growth, no more contribution. Just this heavy, silent realization that the chapter has closed, and yet I'm still being forced to keep reading the empty pages. What is the purpose of persisting when the essence of your life's work has been rendered hollow?",
      "source": "evaluator"
